   "en": "Professor",
   "term": "null",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0004",
   "jp": "もう、帰る時間だね。",
   "en": "It's time to head back already.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0005",
   "jp": "あ～、どっか遊びに行きたいな～。",
   "en": "Aaah, I wanna go somewhere fun!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0006",
   "jp": "何にもないもんね、ここ‥‥。",
   "en": "There's nothing to do here...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0007",
   "jp": "いっつも廊下でぶつかってくる女の子がいるんだけど、{n}あれって俺に気があるのかな？",
   "en": "There's this girl who keeps bumping into me in the hall.{n}Think she's got a thing for me?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0008",
   "jp": "おさげに眼鏡の子だろ？{n}誰にでもぶつかってるよ‥‥。",
   "en": "The girl with pigtails and glasses? She bumps{n}into everyone...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0009",
   "jp": "{s:0000}君、{n}実は君に話したいことがあるんだ。{n}僕の研究室まで来てくれないか？",
   "en": "{s:0000}, there's something I'd like to{n}discuss with you. Could you come to my laboratory?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0010",
   "jp": "行きますか？",
   "en": "Will you go?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0011",
   "jp": "じゃあ、待ってるよ。",
   "en": "All right, I'll be waiting.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0012",
   "jp": "‥‥そうかい。{n}それはとても残念だ。{n}では、僕は失礼する。",
   "en": "...I see. That's a real shame. Well, I'll be going, then.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0013",
   "jp": "アリオストさん、どうかしたのかな？",
   "en": "I wonder what's going on with Ariost-san?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0014",
   "jp": "お兄さま～～～！！",
   "en": "Big Brother!!!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0015",
   "jp": "はあ‥‥。{n}オレってば‥‥。{n}どーしてこんなに失敗続きなんだろうか‥‥。",
   "en": "*sigh* What's wrong with me...? Why do I keep messing{n}everything up...?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0016",
   "jp": "休暇でこんなところへ来て、{n}何するの？",
   "en": "What are you going to do here on your day off?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
