  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0042",
   "jp": "{FB00}秘密にしてるつもりなのね‥‥。",
   "en": "{FB00}So you're trying to keep it a secret...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0043",
   "jp": "{FB00}な、なんだろ‥‥？",
   "en": "{FB00}Wh-what could it be...?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0044",
   "jp": "{FB00}‥‥‥。",
   "en": "{FB00}...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0045",
   "jp": "アリオストの研究室",
   "en": "Ariost's Laboratory",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0046",
   "jp": "やあ、君たちか。{n}来てくれたのは嬉しいけど、{n}今、手が放せないんだ。{p}部屋の中は勝手に見てくれてかまわないよ。",
   "en": "Oh, it's you. I'm glad you came, but I'm in the middle{n}of something.{p}Feel free to look around the room.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0047",
   "jp": "それはね、遺跡を調べるときに{n}まだ動いている罠を見つけるために{n}作った探知機だよ。{p}でも、大きすぎて携帯できなかったんだ。{n}だから今はただのガラクタさ。",
   "en": "That's a detector I built to find traps that are still{n}active when exploring ruins.{p}But it turned out to be too big to carry around. So now{n}it's just a piece of junk.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0048",
   "jp": "そいつの事は、もう話したじゃないか。",
   "en": "I already told you about that one, didn't I?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0049",
   "jp": "すまない、ちょっと時間がなくなってしまった。{n}また今度にしてくれないか？",
   "en": "Sorry, I'm afraid I've run out of time. Could we do this{n}another day?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0050",
   "jp": "それはね、遺跡で見つけたものなんだけど{n}材質がなんだかわからないんだ。{n}表面のなめらかさは磨いて出るものじゃない。{p}かと言って自然のものでもないね。{n}古代文明に関しては、{n}まだまだわからないことだらけだよ。",
   "en": "I found that in some ruins, but I can't identify the{n}material. Polishing couldn't make its surface{n}that smooth.{p}Yet it isn't natural, either. There's still so much we{n}don't know about ancient civilization.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0051",
   "jp": "おっと、それはちょっと見せられないんだ。{n}すまないね。",
   "en": "Oh, I can't let you see that one. Sorry.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0052",
   "jp": "僕は僕で地道に努力するさ。{n}彼女を幸せにするためにね。",
   "en": "I'll keep working at it in my own way. To make{n}her happy.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0053",
   "jp": "ああ、ごめん。{n}さっきは時間を忘れて話してしまったが{n}今日は本当に忙しくてね。{p}また今度、来てくれないか。",
   "en": "Oh, sorry. I lost track of time talking earlier, but I{n}really am busy today.{p}Could you come back another day?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0054",
   "jp": "どうだい？{n}この部屋は僕の今までの研究の成果が{n}つまっているんだ。",
   "en": "Well, what do you think? This room holds the results of{n}all my research so far.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0055",
   "jp": "魔法学院・学食",
   "en": "Magic Academy - Cafeteria",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen192.0056",
   "jp": "{v:01E6}あ、お兄さま★{n}お兄さまに食べて貰おうと思って{n}ケーキを焼いたんですぅ♪",
